  "location": "France",
  "experience_years": 4,
  "timezone": "Europe/Paris",
  "_sources_note": "Pick the sources that match where you are. himalayas = remote worldwide. arbeitnow = Europe and UK, and it flags visa sponsorship. csv_import = a file you export yourself from any board. See search/sources/README.md to add your own.",
